      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another company doesn't make it the issue better. Same issue as now.\n\nThe only solution in my head is that VRChat let the goverment where the person live decide, not a company. Which would also work for Countries where Persona/KWS doesn't offer services.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
